          "loc": {
            "file": "app.py",
            "line": 1,
            "column": 1
          },
          "literal": "aiohttp registers a route by CALL, not by decorator.\n\nA frontend that knew only decorators and `add_url_rule` enumerated ZERO routes of an\nentire application -- and the report still looked complete, because a surface with no\nentry points reads exactly like a surface with nothing to say. Everything inside those\nhandlers was invisible, a SQL injection among it.\n"
        }
      ],
